graph TD
    %% Events and Triggers
    Watermark[Watermark Event Received] -->|Trigger| Scan[Check Partition Workload]

    %% The Legacy/Inefficient Path (Before)
    Scan --> Legacy{Full Sweep?}
    Legacy -->|Yes| All[Scan ALL live partitions]
    All -->|Costly| Process1[Process/Update Idle Partitions]
    Process1 -->|Slow for high cardinality| Finish1[Done]

    %% The Optimized/Frontier State Path (After)
    Scan --> Optimized{Use Frontier State?}
    Optimized -->|Yes| QueryIndex[Query frontier_index_by_time]

    subgraph FrontierState [Frontier State Tables]
        Meta[frontier_meta_by_partition]
        Index[frontier_index_by_time]
    end

    QueryIndex -->|Get Active Partitions| Target[Only process active partitions]
    Target --> Process2[Process/Update relevant partition]
    Process2 --> UpdateMeta[Update frontier_meta_by_partition]
    UpdateMeta --> UpdateIndex[Update frontier_index_by_time]
    UpdateIndex --> Finish2[Done - Efficient]

    %% Styling
    style Optimized fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,stroke-width:2px
    style FrontierState fill:#f8f9fa,stroke:#343a40,stroke-width:1px
    style All fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#dc3545,stroke-width:2px
